\documentclass{report}
\title{Berth Scheduling under Tidal Windows\\at a Mid-Sized Container Port}
\author{K.~Ferreira}
\date{July 2026}
\begin{document}
\maketitle
\input{chapters/intro}
\input{chapters/scheduling}
\input{chapters/results}
\end{document}

\chapter{Results}
The policy was replayed against the historical log.
\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{ll}
\hline
Policy & Median delay (h) \\
\hline
First come first served & 5.6 \\
Tide-aware greedy & 2.1 & best \\
Manual dispatch & 4.0 \\
\hline
\end{tabular}
\end{center}
Median delay falls by more than half,
and no vessel misses its tidal window under the greedy policy.

